OL,3,GNEWSAKnow who is taking your rubbish   
OL,4,Aaway, council urges                    
OL,6,FPeople who pay for their rubbish to be 
OL,7,Ftaken away must be sure they are giving
OL,8,Fit to legal operators and not          
OL,9,Funscrupulous fly-tippers, a council has
OL,10,Fsaid.                                  
OL,12,FCarol, who works for West Berkshire    
OL,13,FCouncil, took BBC Radio Berkshire out  
OL,14,Fon a tour of what her day job entails. 
OL,16,FAccording to the latest government     
OL,17,Ffigures, recorded incidents of         
OL,18,Ffly-tipping across Berkshire's six     
OL,19,Fcouncils increased by about a quarter  
OL,20,Fbetween 2023/24 and 2024/25.           
